---
// Replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider: the site is dark only, like the app it
// documents, whatever the visitor's system prefers or once chose here.
// Inlined so the first paint is already dark.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	// Starlight's own scripts call this to sync theme pickers; there are none.
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
